  "boundary": "Exact selected-build static identity and MethodSpec/type joins; direct selected source order supports structural-only finite framing. The outer tag9A is distinct from its member11 header. DamageUnit has 33 members (0x21), not 21; EffectActionCfg has 85 (0x55). Inline source loads/advances establish raw widths, never output slots. Calculation tags 0/2/3 use independently joined wrappers in this base contract; tags1/5 are separately pinned by buff_calc1_native.json and buff_calc5_native.json. Unselected tags stop before their tag. Raw scalar32 bits remain anonymous. This base contract pins signed count -1/0 for the three unit lists and TerrainEffectData array. Positive elements in the second unit list are separately framed by buff_damage_lists_native.json; first/third list and effect-array positive layouts remain unresolved. Shared reference-list count/loop is conditional on the pinned generic consumer; active provider selection is not proven. Vector3 contains three variable-width scalar payloads, not twelve raw bytes. Known scalar/payload/list primitives and target profiles reuse buff_ec_native.json, buff_b2_native.json and earlier audited helper windows. String decoding, field/gameplay meaning, runtime execution, refill/error parity and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved; physical remainder is explicit opaque."
